WEBVTT

NOTE Actual app components with demonstration data. No real sends.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Share a credential document — demonstration

1
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:09.081
Open a license and choose Share.

2
00:00:09.081 --> 00:00:17.326
Review the linked document and check that it is the file you mean to send.

3
00:00:17.326 --> 00:00:26.119
Choose Email with attachments, enter the recipient, and read the message.

4
00:00:26.119 --> 00:00:35.051
In this demonstration, sending is simulated and no email leaves the computer.

5
00:00:35.051 --> 00:00:43.958
In the live app, check the recipient and selected documents before you send.

6
00:00:43.958 --> 00:00:51.800
This tutorial does not demonstrate real email delivery.

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:55.000
Try it with your own records. Review the result.
